## .NET build output
bin/
obj/
*.user

## Installer packaging output (generated by installers/*/build-*.sh and the
## Windows .iss script - these are Release *artifacts*, not source. They get
## built fresh by CI on every tagged release; never commit them here.
installers/windows/publish/
installers/windows/Output/
installers/macos/build/
installers/linux/build/
installers/linux/*.deb
installers/linux/appimagetool-*.AppImage

## Rider / VS
.vs/
.idea/
*.suo

## Local runtime data (fcms.db, logs, backups) lives entirely outside this
## repo, in the OS app-data directory (see FcmsDbContextFactory.GetAppDataDirectory) -
## never inside the source tree, so there's nothing here to ignore by path.
## A previous **/logs/ and **/backups/ pattern here was removed after it
## silently excluded the real ViewModels/Logs, Views/Logs, and Backup source
## folders from git (Windows' default case-insensitive git config matched
## "logs"/"backups" against "Logs"/"Backup" folders) - a build that works
## locally on Windows but fails on Linux CI with a missing-namespace error
## is the symptom to watch for if a pattern like that gets reintroduced.
**/window-state.json

